        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_Cleared_How">
            <English>The weapon cycles again. Resume firing.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_clear">
            <English>Remove the stuck case</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_clear_How">
            <English>Work the case loose and out of the chamber. Do not force it.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_drop">
            <English>Remove the magazine</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_drop_How">
            <English>Press the magazine release and pull the magazine clear of the well.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_insert">
            <English>Insert a magazine</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_insert_How">
            <English>Push the magazine straight up into the well until it locks. Tug down to check.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_lock">
            <English>Lock the bolt to the rear</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_lock_How">
            <English>Pull the charging handle to the rear and engage the bolt catch. The action stays open.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_look">
            <English>Inspect the chamber</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_look_How">
            <English>Look through the ejection port into the chamber. Identify the stoppage before you go on.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_pull">
            <English>Remove the double feed</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_pull_How">
            <English>Pull each round out through the ejection port. Two rounds are in the receiver.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_rack">
            <English>Pull and release the charging handle</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_rackSlide">
            <English>Rack the slide</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_rack_How">
            <English>Pull it fully to the rear and let go. Do not ride it forward.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_release">
            <English>Release the bolt</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_release_How">
            <English>Press the bolt catch. Let the bolt go forward on its own.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_sweep">
            <English>Clear the ejection port</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_sweep_How">
            <English>Sweep the case out of the port with your hand.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_tap">
            <English>Tap the magazine</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_tap_How">
            <English>Push the magazine up hard until it locks. Tug it down to check it is seated.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_wait">
            <English>Wait out a hangfire</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_mhwm_workbench_Step_wait_How">
            <English>Keep the muzzle pointed in a safe direction. Do not open the action yet.</English>
        </Key>
